cache-keepwarm credits two MIT-licensed predecessors. Its code is written for this plugin's mechanism, an invisible fork replay admitted by one budget; the ideas below were ported, and each licence is carried in full so any overlap stays licensed.

1. claude-cache-warm — https://github.com/FiredMosquito831/claude-cache-warm
   Ideas ported: skip a warm once the cache has expired, a minimum context of 20000 tokens, supersede a pending warm when newer activity arrives.

